# Rock-salt NaCl conventional cell (Fm-3m, a = 5.6402 A) written the way
# Open Babel / SYBYL do: the standard 8-field @<TRIPOS>CRYSIN record
# (a b c alpha beta gamma space_grp setting) after the BOND section.
# Ionic lattice: the file declares no bonds.
@<TRIPOS>MOLECULE
nacl_rocksalt
 8 0 1 0 0
SMALL
NO_CHARGES

@<TRIPOS>ATOM
      1 Na1         0.0000    0.0000    0.0000 Na      1  NACL        0.0000
      2 Na2         2.8201    2.8201    0.0000 Na      1  NACL        0.0000
      3 Na3         2.8201    0.0000    2.8201 Na      1  NACL        0.0000
      4 Na4         0.0000    2.8201    2.8201 Na      1  NACL        0.0000
      5 Cl1         2.8201    0.0000    0.0000 Cl      1  NACL        0.0000
      6 Cl2         0.0000    2.8201    0.0000 Cl      1  NACL        0.0000
      7 Cl3         0.0000    0.0000    2.8201 Cl      1  NACL        0.0000
      8 Cl4         2.8201    2.8201    2.8201 Cl      1  NACL        0.0000
@<TRIPOS>BOND
@<TRIPOS>SUBSTRUCTURE
     1  NACL        1 TEMP              0 ****  ****    0 ROOT
@<TRIPOS>CRYSIN
    5.6402    5.6402    5.6402   90.0000   90.0000   90.0000 225 1
